sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Source admission across database and object storage
  accDescr: Reserve identity in PostgreSQL, store exact source, then atomically finalize queued job and outbox. Concurrent replay may return uploading before storage finishes.
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Django
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant O as Object store
  UI->>API: 1 POST original + requirements<br/>Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: 2.1 Reserve document/job<br/>and upload lease
  DB-->>API: Reservation committed
  API->>O: 2.2 PUT exact original<br/>at generated key
  O-->>API: Storage acknowledgment
  API->>DB: 2.3 Pending document<br/>+ queued job + outbox
  DB-->>API: Finalization committed
  API-->>UI: 202 queued receipt
  Note over UI,DB: Concurrent replay may return 202 uploading<br/>before PUT finishes. No outbox yet.
